description_text:
Simple 3D model of Colosseum modelled in Blender v2.76. The model is completed of materials and textures.You can find the UV Layout in the ZIP - see folder 'UVLayout'.
List of textures:
  - colos.jpg - 2048x2048 px;
The model is available in the following formats:

  - Blender format .BLEND;

  - 3DS format (.3ds);

  - Wavefront OBJ (+ MTL file for materials);

  - COLLADA format (.dae);

  - StereoLithography format (.stl).

The STL format doesn't include the textures.The scene is rendered with Blender.The background of the first preview image is not included in the package.

Ruined Desert environment is a low poly flat shaded environment. It is the perfect package for a small, good looking desert scene.
The package contains 19 prefabs including ruined columns, stones and vegetation.
Features:

  - PBR materials;

  - 1K textures;

